      "id" : "850F6CF6-EF36-4B4C-93AB-7FA4F30ED8C8",
      "note" : "# Genuary 10\n\n> Polar Coordinates\n\nThis is a fairly simple sample, most of the work happens within the `Polar Pixellate` shader - check the source code out!\n\nWe mix two versions of the effect and blend them together with a `Lighten` mix mode.\n\nNode we add a SRGB conversion since we dont quite have color matching in Fabric just yet!"
    }
